  Copyright (c) 2022 OpenAI
  The speech-recognition model is a LoRA fine-tune of whisper-large-v3.

faster-whisper / CTranslate2  --  https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper
  MIT. Used for the deployed int8_float16 conversion.

espeak-ng  --  https://github.com/espeak-ng/espeak-ng  --  GPL-3.0
  Invoked as a SEPARATE PROCESS through its command-line interface, never
